### ==============================================================================
### Evolution API v2 - REST Client Test Requests
### Use with the "REST Client" extension in VS Code
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiKey = evol_whatsapp_api_secret_key_2026
@instance = my_whatsapp_bot
@testNumber = 15551234567

### 1. Healthcheck / Server Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/
apikey: {{apiKey}}

### 2. Create New WhatsApp Instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/instance/create
apikey: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instanceName": "{{instance}}",
  "qrcode": true,
  "integration": "WHATSAPP-BAILEYS"
}

### 3. Connect Instance & Get QR Code (Base64)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instance/connect/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}

### 4. Check Connection Status (open, close, connecting)
GET {{baseUrl}}/instance/connectionState/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Fetch All Instances
GET {{baseUrl}}/instance/fetchInstances
apikey: {{apiKey}}

### 6. Send WhatsApp Text Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/sendText/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "{{testNumber}}",
  "text": "Hello from Evolution API v2! 🚀"
}

### 7. Send WhatsApp Image Media
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/sendMedia/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "{{testNumber}}",
  "mediatype": "image",
  "mimetype": "image/png",
  "caption": "Photo sent via Evolution API",
  "media": "https://picsum.photos/400/300"
}

### 8. Send WhatsApp Voice Audio Note (PTT)
POST {{baseUrl}}/message/sendWhatsAppAudio/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "number": "{{testNumber}}",
  "audio": "https://www.soundhelix.com/examples/mp3/SoundHelix-Song-1.mp3"
}

### 9. Set Webhook Configuration
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook/set/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "url": "https://webhook.site/replace-with-your-uuid",
  "webhook_by_events": false,
  "events": [
    "MESSAGES_UPSERT",
    "CONNECTION_UPDATE",
    "SEND_MESSAGE",
    "QRCODE_UPDATED"
  ]
}

### 10. Disconnect / Logout WhatsApp Session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/instance/logout/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}

### 11. Delete Instance
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/instance/delete/{{instance}}
apikey: {{apiKey}}
